# Buzzler Agency - Environment Variables

# 1. Lead Email Notifications (via Resend - https://resend.com)
# Free tier gives 3,000 emails/month (100/day).
# Set this in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Buzzler Leads <onboarding@resend.dev>
CONTACT_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=hello@buzzleragency.com

# 2. Optional: CRM / Database / Slack / Discord / Zapier Webhook
# Inquiries will be sent as JSON POST to this webhook URL:
# LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://api.crm.com/v1/leads
